OL,3,GNEWSAStudent: Uni strikes 'not what we
OL,4,Asigned up for'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student has said she feels
OL,7,F"shorthanded" as staff at University of
OL,8,FNottingham are to go on strike for
OL,9,Fthree months.
OL,11,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,12,Fsaid its members would strike on
OL,13,FWednesday and Thursday and would then
OL,14,Fcarry out "sustained strike action"
OL,15,Ffrom 5 October to 11 December over the
OL,16,FFuture Nottingham restructuring plans.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the University of
OL,19,FNottingham said it was "disappointed"
OL,20,Fby the timing of industrial action,
OL,21,Fadding many students would be
OL,22,F"unaffected" by the strikes.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
